Hey Tejas,

Solving incidents is a multiplayer game. And nobody wants to be on call forever.

With an on-call schedule, your team takes turns, and Better Stack always knows
who to reach.

Create an on-call schedule →
[https://betterstack.com/ahoy/messages/nOwtT3BHCHP6gvq8n8JDt0llCC3mz9Rc/click?signature=473ce9ef1ecae9069b3a896edbc8636ca0c73844&url=https%3A%2F%2Fincidents.betterstack.com%2Fteam%2F0%2Foncalls%2Fnew%3Futm_source%3Dintro%252Fonboarding_drip_journey%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dreliability_on_call_reminder]
5 minutes

Create an on-call schedule
[https://betterstack.com/static/images/email/onboarding/on-call-calendars.png]
https://betterstack.com/ahoy/messages/nOwtT3BHCHP6gvq8n8JDt0llCC3mz9Rc/click?signature=473ce9ef1ecae9069b3a896edbc8636ca0c73844&url=https%3A%2F%2Fincidents.betterstack.com%2Fteam%2F0%2Foncalls%2Fnew%3Futm_source%3Dintro%252Fonboarding_drip_journey%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dreliability_on_call_reminder


HOW DOES IT WORK?

Pick who is on call and when. Set how to reach them: Slack, push, SMS or a phone
call. Swap shifts with a one-click override when someone is on holiday.

Phone calls and SMS alerts are unlimited. No surprises on your bill.

Watch a demo
[https://betterstack.com/static/images/email/onboarding/demos/should-you-run-oncall-schedule.png]
https://betterstack.com/ahoy/messages/nOwtT3BHCHP6gvq8n8JDt0llCC3mz9Rc/click?signature=08124729fe1bf716f65c531e00a4d3a8fb5389e8&url=https%3A%2F%2Fbetterstack.com%2Fdemos%2Fon-call%2F%3Futm_source%3Dintro%252Fonboarding_drip_journey%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dreliability_on_call_reminder


FIRST TIME SETTING THIS UP?

Watch a demo
[https://betterstack.com/ahoy/messages/nOwtT3BHCHP6gvq8n8JDt0llCC3mz9Rc/click?signature=08124729fe1bf716f65c531e00a4d3a8fb5389e8&url=https%3A%2F%2Fbetterstack.com%2Fdemos%2Fon-call%2F%3Futm_source%3Dintro%252Fonboarding_drip_journey%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dreliability_on_call_reminder],
